      "preview": "זָעַם: indignar-se; denunciar, amaldiçoar.",
      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">זָעַם</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: indignar-se (</strong>cf. aramaico (raro) <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܥܰܡ</span> <em>censurar</em>, e substantivo <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܽܘܥܳܡܳܐ</span>; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">تَزَغَّمَ</span> onomatopeico, relativo ao <em>bramido</em> do camelo, à <em>fala irada</em>, ver Frey, De sobre <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:12\" href=\"/Psalms.7.12\">ψ 7:12</a><strong>)</strong>—Perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:8\" href=\"/Numbers.23.8\">Nu 23:8</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָעַמְתָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.12\">Zc 1:12</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶזְעֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:8\" href=\"/Numbers.23.8\">Nu 23:8</a>; 3.ª pessoa plural com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְעָמוּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.24\">Pr 24:24</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹעֲמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:7\" href=\"/Numbers.23.7\">Nu 23:7</a> (por <span dir=\"rtl\">זָֽעָמֳה</span> Ges<sup>§ 64, (2)</sup>); particípio ativo <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹעֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:12\" href=\"/Psalms.7.12\">ψ 7:12</a>; passivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זְעוּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.14\">Pr 22:14</a>; feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">זְעוּמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:10\" href=\"/Micah.6.10\">Mi 6:10</a>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong> <strong>1.</strong>  <em>indignar-se, ter indignação</em>, de príncipe hostil <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל בְּרִית קוֹדֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:30\" href=\"/Daniel.11.30\">Dn 11:30</a>; nas demais passagens, de Yahweh, que é <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל זֹעֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:12\" href=\"/Psalms.7.12\">ψ 7:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹפֵט</span>), com acusativo de inimigo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.14\">Is 66:14</a>; cidades de Judá <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.12\">Zc 1:12</a>; povo <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:4\" href=\"/Malachi.1.4\">Mal 1:4</a>; um homem <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.14\">Pr 22:14</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  é provavelmente denominativo de <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעַם</span> (ver Buhl). <em>expressar indignação por palavras, denunciar, amaldiçoar</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יִקְּבֻהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.24\">Pr 24:24</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶקֹּב</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽרָה־</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:7\" href=\"/Numbers.23.7\">Nu 23:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:8\" href=\"/Numbers.23.8\">8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (E); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיפַת רָזוֹן זְעוּמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:10\" href=\"/Micah.6.10\">Mi 6:10</a> <em>um efa de escassez, denunciado</em>, ou <em>amaldiçoado</em>.<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Particípio plural <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּנִים נִזְעָמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.23\">Pr 25:23</a> <em>rosto agitado pela indignação</em>.",
