      "preview": "זַ֫עַם: indignação.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זַ֫עַם</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.25\">Is 10:25</a></sup> <strong>indignação</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.25\">Is 10:25</a> + 7 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָ֑עַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.20\">Is 26:20</a> + 2 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעְמִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.5\">Is 10:5</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעַמְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:11\" href=\"/Psalms.102.11\">ψ 102:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעְמֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:4\" href=\"/Psalms.38.4\">ψ 38:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:25\" href=\"/Psalms.69.25\">69:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעְמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.5\">Is 13:5</a> + 3 vezes;—<em>indignação</em> de homens <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:16\" href=\"/Hosea.7.16\">Ho 7:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.17\">Je 15:17</a>; nas demais passagens, de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.20\">Is 26:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.27\">30:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:6\" href=\"/Nahum.1.6\">Na 1:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:12\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.12\">Hb 3:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:4\" href=\"/Psalms.38.4\">ψ 38:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:11\" href=\"/Psalms.102.11\">102:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:36\" href=\"/Daniel.11.36\">Dn 11:36</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חרון אף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:25\" href=\"/Psalms.69.25\">ψ 69:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:8\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.8\">Zp 3:8</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עברה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:49\" href=\"/Psalms.78.49\">ψ 78:49</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:36\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.36\">Ez 21:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.31\">22:31</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קצף</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.10\">Je 10:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:11\" href=\"/Psalms.102.11\">ψ 102:11</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.5\">Is 10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.27\">30:27</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בזעם אפו</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:6\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.6\">La 2:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁפך ז׳ על</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:25\" href=\"/Psalms.69.25\">ψ 69:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:36\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.36\">Ez 21:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.31\">22:31</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:8\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.8\">Zp 3:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּלֵי זַעַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.5\">Is 13:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.25\">Je 50:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יום זעם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.24\">Ez 22:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אחרית הזעם</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:19\" href=\"/Daniel.8.19\">Dn 8:19</a>.",
