      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זָעַף</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: estar de mau humor, contrariado; enfurecer-se (</strong>aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܥܰܦ</span> <em>enfurecer-se contra</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זְעַף</span> <em>enfurecer-se</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעֲפָא</span> <em>tempestade;</em> cf. samaritano <span dir=\"rtl\">ࠆࠏࠐ</span><em>soprar, respirar</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְעַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.3\">Pr 19:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּזְעַף</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">וַעְפּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>; particípio plural <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹעֲפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:6\" href=\"/Genesis.40.6\">Gn 40:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:10\" href=\"/Daniel.1.10\">Dn 1:10</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>estar de mau humor</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:6\" href=\"/Genesis.40.6\">Gn 40:6</a> (E); <em>abatido</em>, do rosto <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:10\" href=\"/Daniel.1.10\">Dn 1:10</a>; seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.3\">Pr 19:3</a> <em>irritar-se contra</em> (AV). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>enfurecer-se</em> (tardio: cf. aramaico acima) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>; seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> v. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">19</a>.",
