      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זַ֫עַף</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino: fúria, furor, ira</strong> (poético e tardio)—<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 16:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.16.10\">2 Ch 16:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.9\">28:9</a>; construto <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.30\">Is 30:30</a> + 2 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זַעְפּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:15\" href=\"/Jonah.1.15\">Jon 1:15</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>ira</em> de rei, que leva à violência <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.12\">Pr 19:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נַהַם כַּכְּפִיר</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 16:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.16.10\">2 Ch 16:10</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּז׳ עִמּוֹ עַל־זאת</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כעם</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.9\">28:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ אַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.30\">Is 30:30</a> <em>furor</em> da ira (de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:9\" href=\"/Micah.7.9\">Mi 7:9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>furor</em> do mar <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:15\" href=\"/Jonah.1.15\">Jon 1:15</a>.",
