      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְרֶה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>forcado</strong>, com seis dentes (= <span dir=\"rtl\">مذراة</span>) usado na joeira, cf. Wetzst<sup>ZPV 1891, xiv. 2</sup>; para joeirar forragem <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹרֶה בָרַחַת וּבְמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.24\">Is 30:24</a>; figurado para joeirar, isto é, castigar o povo <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶזְרֵם בְּמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.7\">Je 15:7</a>.",
