      "html": "† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זֶ֫רַח</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino. (</strong>sobre a forma cf. Lg<sup>BN77, and Anm.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  𝔊 Ζαρα, filho de Judá e Tamar <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:30\" href=\"/Genesis.38.30\">Gn 38:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:12\" href=\"/Genesis.46.12\">46:12</a> (ambos J), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.4\">1 Ch 2:4</a> (todos <span dir=\"rtl\">זָ֑רַח</span>), v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.6\">6</a>; como chefe de família <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:20\" href=\"/Numbers.26.20\">Nu 26:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:1\" href=\"/Joshua.7.1\">Jos 7:1</a> (ambos P), v. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:18\" href=\"/Joshua.7.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:24\" href=\"/Joshua.7.24\">24</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:20\" href=\"/Joshua.22.20\">22:20</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.6\">1 Ch 9:6</a> (𝔊L Ζηρα), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.24\">Ne 11:24</a> (cf. Sm<sup>Listen 7</sup>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  Edomitas: <strong>a.</strong>  𝔊 Ζαρε <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:13\" href=\"/Genesis.36.13\">Gn 36:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:17\" href=\"/Genesis.36.17\">17</a> (ambos P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.37\">1 Ch 1:37</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  𝔊 Ζαρα <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:33\" href=\"/Genesis.36.33\">Gn 36:33</a> (P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.44\">1 Ch 1:44</a> (<strong>b</strong>=<strong>a</strong>?).<br><strong>3.</strong>  𝔊L Ζαρα, levitas: <strong>a.</strong>  (variante Ιααρα) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.6\">1 Ch 6:6</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  (variante Ζααραι) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.26\">1 Ch 6:26</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  chefe de uma família simeonita, 𝔊 Ζαρα <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:13\" href=\"/Numbers.26.13\">Nu 26:13</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.24\">1 Ch 4:24</a> (variante Ζαρες) (= <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹחַר</span> 𝔊 Σααρ <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:10\" href=\"/Genesis.46.10\">Gn 46:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:15\" href=\"/Exodus.6.15\">Ex 6:15</a>, cf. Di <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:13\" href=\"/Numbers.26.13\">Nu 26:13</a>).<br><strong>5.</strong>  um cuchita, 𝔊 Ζαρε, inimigo do rei Asa <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.8\">2 Ch 14:8</a>.",
