      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶזְרָח</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37\" href=\"/Psalms.37\">ψ 37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35\" href=\"/Psalms.35\">35</a> <strong>um nativo (</strong><em>aquele que surge do solo;</em> = ‘membro livre de uma tribo’ RS<sup>Semi. 75</sup><strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.34\">Lv 19:34</a> + 13 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶזְרַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:19\" href=\"/Exodus.12.19\">Ex 12:19</a> + 2 vezes;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>um nativo</em> israelita, geralmente coletivo, com artigo, <span dir=\"rtl\">כל־הָא׳ בישׂראל</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:42\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.42\">Lv 23:42</a> (H), cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:13\" href=\"/Numbers.15.13\">Nu 15:13</a> (P); nas demais passagens oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּר</span> (ver respectivo verbete):—<span dir=\"rtl\">הָא׳ בִּבְנֵי ישׂר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:29\" href=\"/Numbers.15.29\">Nu 15:29</a> (P), cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.22\">Ez 47:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶזְרַח הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:19\" href=\"/Exodus.12.19\">Ex 12:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:48\" href=\"/Exodus.12.48\">48</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:14\" href=\"/Numbers.9.14\">Nu 9:14</a> (todos P); <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מִכֶּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.34\">Lv 19:34</a> ver também <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.15\">17:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.26\">18:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.16\">24:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.22\">22</a> (todos H); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:49\" href=\"/Exodus.12.49\">Ex 12:49</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:29\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.29\">Lv 16:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:30\" href=\"/Numbers.15.30\">Nu 15:30</a> (todos P), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:33\" href=\"/Joshua.8.33\">Jos 8:33</a> (D).<br><strong>2.</strong>  uma árvore <em>nativa</em>, que cresce em seu solo natural <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ רַעֲנָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:35\" href=\"/Psalms.37.35\">ψ 37:35</a> (figura do ímpio próspero).",
