      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְרְעֵאלִי</span></big>  <strong>masculino.</strong>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְרְעֵאלִית</span> <strong>feminino.</strong>, <strong>adjetivo gentílico.</strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong>masculino.</strong> de <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְרְעֶאל</span> <strong>1 b</strong>; sempre <span dir=\"rtl\">נָבוֹת הַיִּז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.1\">1 K 21:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.16\">16</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.21\">2 K 9:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.25\">25</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong>feminino.</strong> de <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְרְעֶאל</span> <strong>1 a</strong>; sempre <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִינֹעַם הַיִּז׳</span> uma mulher de Davi; terminação <span dir=\"rtl\">ִית</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.5\">1 S 30:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.2\">2 S 2:2</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.1\">1 Ch 3:1</a>; terminação <span dir=\"rtl\">ִת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 27:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.27.3\">1 S 27:3</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.2\">2 S 3:2</a> (= <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.1\">1 Ch 3:1</a>).",
