      "html": "II. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">זרע</span></big></big>  <strong>(</strong>cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَرَعَ</span> <em>estender, alongar</em>, especialmente braço ou perna; <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَرْعٌ</span> <em>poder</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ذِرَاعٌ</span> <em>antebraço</em><strong>)</strong>.",
