      "preview": "זָרַק: arremessar, lançar, espalhar abundantemente.",
      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">זָרַק</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: arremessar</strong> ou <strong>lançar</strong> (em quantidade), <strong>espalhar abundantemente (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem;</em> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">זְרַק</span> <em>idem.</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܪܰܩ</span> <em>dispersar;</em> assírio <em>zarâḳu</em> Lotz<sup> TP 138</sup> Jäger<sup> BAS ii. 292 Anm.</sup>; cf. também árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">زَرَقَ</span> <em>lançar contra, perfurar</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">زَرَّاقَةٌ</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">مِزْرَاقٌ</span> <em>dardo</em> = etíope ምዝራቅ <strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:6\" href=\"/Exodus.24.6\">Ex 24:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.6\">Lv 17:6</a>, com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זְרָקוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:8\" href=\"/Exodus.9.8\">Ex 9:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זָֽרְקָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:9\" href=\"/Hosea.7.9\">Ho 7:9</a> (12 vezes perfeito); imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְרֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.2\">Lv 7:2</a> + 16 vezes; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לִזְרֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.18\">Ez 43:18</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">זְרֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.2\">Ez 10:2</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹרֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.14\">Lv 7:14</a>, plural <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹרְקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.16\">2 Ch 30:16</a>; <strong>1.</strong>  <em>arremessar</em> (a punhados, ver <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:8\" href=\"/Exodus.9.8\">Ex 9:8</a>; ou de uma <em>bacia</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְרָק</span>; oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">הִזָּה</span> <em>aspergir</em> com o dedo): <strong>a.</strong>  cominho <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.25\">Is 28:25</a>, pó, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.4\">2 Ch 34:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 2:12\" href=\"/Job.2.12\">Jb 2:12</a>; cinzas <span dir=\"rtl\">השׁמימה</span>, para o céu, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:8\" href=\"/Exodus.9.8\">Ex 9:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:10\" href=\"/Exodus.9.10\">10</a> (P), brasas de fogo <span dir=\"rtl\">על העיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.2\">Ez 10:2</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  sangue, <span dir=\"rtl\">על (ה)מזבח</span> <em>lançar</em> (de uma bacia) contra o altar <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:6\" href=\"/Exodus.24.6\">Ex 24:6</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.6\">Lv 17:6</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:17\" href=\"/Numbers.18.17\">Nu 18:17</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.13\">2 K 16:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.15\">15</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.18\">Ez 43:18</a>, especialmente no ritual, <span dir=\"rtl\">על המזבח סביב</span> contra o altar ao redor <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:16\" href=\"/Exodus.29.16\">Ex 29:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:20\" href=\"/Exodus.29.20\">20</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.5\">Lv 1:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.2\">3:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.2\">7:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.19\">8:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.12\">9:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.18\">18</a> (todos P); seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">על העם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:8\" href=\"/Exodus.24.8\">Ex 24:8</a> (JE), seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">המזבחה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.22\">2 Ch 29:22</a><sup>(×3)</sup>; sem designação de lugar <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.14\">Lv 7:14</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.16\">2 Ch 30:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.11\">35:11</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <em>água</em> para purificação, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.25\">Ez 36:25</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  intransitivo (se a leitura for verdadeira) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:9\" href=\"/Hosea.7.9\">Ho 7:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּם שֵׂיבָה זָֽרְקָה בּוֹ</span> cabelos grisalhos são <em>abundantes</em> nele (ler talvez <span dir=\"rtl\">זָֽרְחָה</span>, como em <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>).<br><strong>Pu.</strong>  Perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹרַק</span>, de água de purificação <em>derramada</em> sobre <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַל)</span> alguém contaminado por um cadáver <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:13\" href=\"/Numbers.19.13\">Nu 19:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:20\" href=\"/Numbers.19.20\">20</a> (P).",
