      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְרָק</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:84\" href=\"/Numbers.7.84\">Nu 7:84</a></sup> <strong>taça, bacia</strong> (propõe recipiente para <em>lançar</em> ou <em>arremessar</em> um líquido); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:13\" href=\"/Numbers.7.13\">Nu 7:13</a> + 13 vezes, plural <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְרָקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:20\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.20\">Zc 14:20</a>, construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְרְקֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:84\" href=\"/Numbers.7.84\">Nu 7:84</a> + 2 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְרָקוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:69\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.69\">Ne 7:70</a> + 9 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְרָקֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:3\" href=\"/Exodus.38.3\">Ex 38:3</a> + 2 vezes, com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְרְקֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:3\" href=\"/Exodus.27.3\">Ex 27:3</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>taça</em> para vinho <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:6\" href=\"/Amos.6.6\">Am 6:6</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  nas demais passagens para uso no ritual de sacrifício: <strong>a.</strong>  para uso no altar <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:3\" href=\"/Exodus.27.3\">Ex 27:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:3\" href=\"/Exodus.38.3\">38:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:14\" href=\"/Numbers.4.14\">Nu 4:14</a> (todos P), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:40\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.40\">1 K 7:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:45\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.45\">45</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.18\">Je 52:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.15\">Zc 9:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:20\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.20\">14:20</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  dadas pelos príncipes, cheias de farinha misturada com azeite para uma <span dir=\"rtl\">מנחה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:13\" href=\"/Numbers.7.13\">Nu 7:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:19\" href=\"/Numbers.7.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:25\" href=\"/Numbers.7.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:31\" href=\"/Numbers.7.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:37\" href=\"/Numbers.7.37\">37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:43\" href=\"/Numbers.7.43\">43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:49\" href=\"/Numbers.7.49\">49</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:55\" href=\"/Numbers.7.55\">55</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:61\" href=\"/Numbers.7.61\">61</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:67\" href=\"/Numbers.7.67\">67</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:73\" href=\"/Numbers.7.73\">73</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:79\" href=\"/Numbers.7.79\">79</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:84\" href=\"/Numbers.7.84\">84</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:85\" href=\"/Numbers.7.85\">85</a> (P). <strong>c.</strong>  bacias de ouro para uso no templo <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:50\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.50\">1 K 7:50</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.14\">2 K 12:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.15\">25:15</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.17\">1 Ch 28:17</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.8\">2 Ch 4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.22\">22</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.19\">Je 52:19</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  bacias de ouro para o segundo templo <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:69\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.69\">Ne 7:70</a>.",
