      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֫בֶל</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:14\" href=\"/Joshua.2.14\">Jos 2:14</a></sup> <strong>feminino.</strong> †<a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:6\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.6\">Zp 2:6</a> (mas ver abaixo) corda, território, grupo; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:15\" href=\"/Joshua.2.15\">Jos 2:15</a> +; construto <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.4\">Dt 3:4</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫בֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:29\" href=\"/Joshua.19.29\">Jos 19:29</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חַבְלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 18:10\" href=\"/Job.18.10\">Jb 18:10</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲבָלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.2\">2 S 8:2</a> + 10 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.13\">Ez 47:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:7\" href=\"/Job.21.7\">Jb 21:7</a> ver abaixo; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חַבְלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:5\" href=\"/Joshua.17.5\">Jos 17:5</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:3\" href=\"/Psalms.116.3\">ψ 116:3</a> + 4 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:5\" href=\"/Psalms.18.5\">ψ 18:5</a> (ler <span dir=\"rtl\">משׁברי</span> ver abaixo); com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲבָלָ֑יִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.23\">Is 33:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲבָלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.20\">Is 33:20</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>corda, cabo</em>, com que homens foram baixados <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:15\" href=\"/Joshua.2.15\">Jos 2:15</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.6\">Je 38:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.13\">13</a>, ou pedras arrastadas <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.13\">2 S 17:13</a>; de tendas <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.20\">Is 33:20</a>; cordame de navio v. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.23\">23</a>; para atar <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.24\">Ez 27:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:25\" href=\"/Job.40.25\">Jb 40:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a>; símbolo de cativeiro ou sujeição <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.31\">1 K 20:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:32\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.32\">32</a>; figura de laço para os ímpios <a data-ref=\"Job 18:10\" href=\"/Job.18.10\">Jb 18:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכֻּדְתּוֹ</span>), armado pelos ímpios <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:6\" href=\"/Psalms.140.6\">ψ 140:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּח</span>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:61\" href=\"/Psalms.119.61\">ψ 119:61</a> <em>cordas de homens ímpios me cercaram;</em> de ímpios retidos <span dir=\"rtl\">בחבלי חַטָּאתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.22\">Pr 5:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַשָּׁ֑וְא</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.18\">Is 5:18</a> <em>cordas</em> (<em>cabos</em>) <em>de iniquidade</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּעֲבוֹת הָעֲגָלָה</span>); de cordas de angústia <span dir=\"rtl\">(עֹ֑נִי)</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:8\" href=\"/Job.36.8\">Jb 36:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זִקִּים</span>); assim <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְלֵי מָוֶת</span> (provavelmente) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:3\" href=\"/Psalms.116.3\">ψ 116:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְלֵי שׁאוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:6\" href=\"/Psalms.18.6\">ψ 18:6</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.6\">2 S 22:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹקְשֵׁי מָוֶת</span>);—por <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְלֵי מות</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:5\" href=\"/Psalms.18.5\">ψ 18:5</a> ler <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁבְּרֵי</span>, ver <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.5\">2 S 22:5</a> e ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלֵי בְלִיַּעַל</span>, De Che Bae; atrair <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחַבְלֵי אָדָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:4\" href=\"/Hosea.11.4\">Ho 11:4</a> (isto é, <em>humanamente</em>, bondosamente); de corda da vida <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבֶל הַכֶּסֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.6\">Ec 12:6</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>corda de medir, linha</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מִדָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:5\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.5\">Zc 2:5</a>; assim <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> só <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.2\">2 S 8:2</a><sup>(×3)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Amos 7:17\" href=\"/Amos.7.17\">Am 7:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 2:5\" href=\"/Micah.2.5\">Mi 2:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:55\" href=\"/Psalms.78.55\">ψ 78:55</a>; figurado (de vida favorecida) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:6\" href=\"/Psalms.16.6\">ψ 16:6</a>; em geral, da porção ou sorte de alguém <a data-ref=\"Job 21:17\" href=\"/Job.21.17\">Jb 21:17</a> segundo 𝔗 Thes Add. Ew Di e outros, mas menos preferível, ver <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חֵ֫בֶל\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חֵ֫בֶל\">חֵבֶל</a>. Daí<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>porção medida, quinhão, parte, região</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ נַחֲלָה</span> <em>porção herdada</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.9\">Dt 32:9</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.18\">1 Ch 16:18</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:11\" href=\"/Psalms.105.11\">ψ 105:11</a>; também <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> só <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:5\" href=\"/Joshua.17.5\">Jos 17:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:14\" href=\"/Joshua.17.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:9\" href=\"/Joshua.19.9\">19:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.13\">Ez 47:13</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">חבלים</span>; 𝔙 𝔗 leem como dual, ver Ew Sm Da e outros; Co suprime por razões internas); de determinadas regiões <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ אַרְגֹּב</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.4\">Dt 3:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.14\">14</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.13\">1 K 4:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ אַכְזִיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:29\" href=\"/Joshua.19.29\">Jos 19:29</a> (se a leitura for verdadeira, ver WMM<sup>Asien 194</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַיָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:5\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.5\">Zp 2:5</a>; também v. <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:6\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.6\">6</a>, mas <span dir=\"rtl\">היתה ח׳</span> aqui é duvidoso; Sta propõe 2.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">הָיִת</span>, e suprime <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הים</span>; sem <span dir=\"rtl\">היס</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:7\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.7\">7</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <em>grupo, companhia</em> de profetas <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.5\">1 S 10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.10\">10</a>.—II. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבֶל</span> ver sob II. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חָבַל²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חָבַל²\">חָבַל</a>.",
