      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְבֻּלָה</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: direção, conselho (</strong>provavelmente originalmente de puxar <em>cordas</em>, isto é, <em>governar, dirigir</em> um navio, ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֹבֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_חֹבֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֵל</a>, assim Thes; ver De <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.5\">Pr 1:5</a><strong>)</strong>;—somente plural e somente na literatura sapiencial <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְבֻּלוֹת</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.5\">Pr 1:5</a> + 3 vezes; construto <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.5\">Pr 12:5</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְבּוּלֹתָ֯ו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 37:12\" href=\"/Job.37.12\">Jb 37:12</a>—<em>direção, orientação</em> (isto é, por Deus) <a data-ref=\"Job 37:12\" href=\"/Job.37.12\">Jb 37:12</a> (de nuvem de trovoada); <em>conselhos</em> dos ímpios <span dir=\"rtl\">(רשׁעים)</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.5\">Pr 12:5</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְשְׁבוֹת צדיקים</span>); em geral <em>bons e sábios conselhos</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.5\">Pr 1:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.14\">11:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹב יועֵץ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.6\">24:6</a> (‖ <em>idem.</em>); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.18\">20:18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵצָה</span>).",
